   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "while (!q.empty()) {\n    Node *n = q.front(); q.pop();\n    cout << n->val;\n    if (n->left) q.push(n->left);\n    if (n->right) q.push(n->right);\n}",
